WEBVTT

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.730
Shinobu? Shinobu!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.510
Your dad's home.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:13.240
Really?!

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.550
Ah, that's good.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.190
<b>Souta 
Incoming Call</b>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:56.700
What's up?

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.450
Nakaji. Hewwo.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.820
Hey, now. Poco, give that back.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:02.780
Nakaji!

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:04.960
Come on, Poco. Now.

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:04.960
Huh?

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:15.630
<b>Poco's Udon World</b>

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.260
<b>Chicken on the Bone</b>

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:45.220
Episode 5: "Chicken on the Bone"

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:45.230
Poco, you're eating too wildly. 
You'll get your hands sticky.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.470
Nakajima, you have all you like, too.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.190
It's my treat.

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:53.410
I do love the chicken here...

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.330
But I drove here.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.110
If I can't drink beer, this is just torture!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.490
Actually, I have a favor to ask of you...

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:03.240
No. Whatever it is, it's bound 
to be somethin' annoying.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.250
Don't drag me into it.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.370
Come on! Join me for a while. 
You're free today, aren't you?

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.370
I got somethin' to do tonight.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:13.490
We'll be done by then. Please?

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.440
The flavor is already so spicy and juicy.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:26.720
But...

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.730
Paired with fresh cabbage, 
it's even more perfect...

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.930
The runt understands that instinctively.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.900
What are you mumbling to yourself?

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.050
Hurry up and eat before it gets cold.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.590
Dang it!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.150
It's amazing!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.120
Nakaji, yummy?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.550
Looks like we've reached an agreement.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.210
Souta, juice.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.040
Juice!

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.090
So, where are we goin'?

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.560
Just to the high school.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.470
Huh? <i>Our</i> high school? Why?

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:06.210
Juice. Juice.

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:07.800
Manabe-san from our 
second-year class asked me

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:10.150
to make a video for a class reunion.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.840
She wants me to make a movie 
of the teachers who can't attend.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.460
Like Sonezaki-sensei, 
the Classic Japanese teacher.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.140
You know, the one everyone 
called "Old Man Sone"?

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.300
Listen.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:25.740
Huh?

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:29.000
You've been gallavantin' around 
with that runt all the time.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.240
What about your job?

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.320
Uh...

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.690
Well... I'm still on vacation, so...

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.750
I don't know what all is goin' on, but...

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.090
You gotta get yourself more together.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.930
Bad! Bad!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.520
Nakaji, bad! Nakaji, bad!

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.450
Poco!

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:03.000
I'll buy you another one, okay?

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.280
Don't spoil him!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.290
I never expected you to come 
with a child in tow, Tawara-kun.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:15.570
Er... Yeah, well...

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.640
You never know what'll happen in life!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:26.480
Nakajima-kun, are you going to 
take over your father's hospital?

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:30.650
I heard you're working at the hospital 
over by Ritsurin right now.

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.480
I'm still in training.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.110
And I don't know if I'll take it over...

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.340
Huh? Really?

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.810
It's complicated.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.690
Seeing you two sitting next to each other

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.450
reminds me of our supplementary 
Classic Japanese lessons.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.090
You both had terrible grades!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.700
Yeah, well, mine were better than Souta's.

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:57.960
What?! Mine were better!

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.080
No, mine were!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.090
Ruu raru ruu raru suu sasu shimu!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.090
<i>[Note - A melody used to help memorize 
classic Japanese verb conjugations]</i>

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:02.790
Imperfective! Conjunctive! Predicative!

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.500
Attributive! Hypothetical! Imperative!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.460
Anybody can do rote memorization!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.680
Oh, shut up.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.360
Bad! Bad!

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:11.220
Bad! Bad! Souta! Nakaji! Be nice!

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:14.280
Poco's in a huff...

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:16.510
That's right.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.440
How bad off must you be, to need
such a little tyke to scold you?

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.160
I didn't cover this in our lessons,

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:28.170
but having friendships that don't change, 
even as you age, is a wonderful thing.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:33.120
Don't ever forget that.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:40.240
Wow! This tree's still here?

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.460
What are you doing?

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:49.550
I used to stash my dirty mags 
inside this tree, way back when.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.830
Of course, there's nothin' here now.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.140
Souta!

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.530
Nakaji!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.640
Brings back memories, doesn't it?

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:09.400
You know, I...

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:13.780
I haven't gone to even one of 
our class reunions or anything.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:18.790
After I moved to Tokyo, I fell out of 
touch with the friends I had here.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.040
Maybe...

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:24.980
Deep down, maybe I did look down on them.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.650
Just because I went to the big city...

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:29.380
I guess I had the wrong idea in my head.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.760
I've always thought you 
were wrong in the head, too.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:34.980
Ouch...

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.280
It might be late in coming,

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:42.560
but I agreed to work on the movie

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.630
because, even if it's little by little,

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.120
I wanted to get back in touch with this place.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:54.450
Hey.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.320
Huh?

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.210
What's that?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.830
Souta!

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.040
Hey! Don't run this way, idiot!

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:08.590
It's huge!

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:10.960
Hey, weren't you always afraid of big dogs?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.970
You're bawling?!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:12.970
<b>Waaah</b>

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:12.970
<b>Waaah</b>

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.660
I can't! I seriously can't handle this!

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.810
For the love of God!

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.470
This crap always happens 
when we're with the runt!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.250
Shoe!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:23.560
Poco!

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:29.480
Hey, you!

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:32.760
Whaddaya think you're doin', fool?!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:49.590
Nakaji.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.570
Are you hurt? Do you feel okay?

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:52.960
Owie, owie?

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.340
Jeez, what are you doing?

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:59.100
Shuddup. I do what I want.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:02.180
Honestly, you're so...

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:07.010
You always stink like soup stock!

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:09.250
Get 'im, John! Bite 'im!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:11.480
Hey, you!

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:18.580
Whaddaya think you're doin', fools?!

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:23.040
You're as stupid and cool as ever.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.410
The "stupid" wasn't necessary.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.760
I wonder where its owner is.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.520
Oh, yeah.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.780
You said you're busy tonight, right?

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.960
If you need to go...

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:39.590
Ah, right.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:41.770
You oughta come with me.

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:42.380
Huh?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:46.500
It's the least ya could do after 
draggin' me into your headaches.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:47.640
Yeah, sure.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:48.980
I'm sorry!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.990
I-I'm so sorry. My dog...

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.550
Wait, huh?

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.680
From Tawara Udon!

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:01.130
Er...

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:03.240
Oh, uh... I'm Tawara Souta.

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:05.270
Poco!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.840
Huh? Is his name... Poco?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:10.760
Yeah... Actually...

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:13.300
Oh, wow! It's like a tanuki's name!

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:17.830
Oh! My name is Fujiyama Sae.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.960
I really am sorry for the trouble.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:23.000
Nah, it's no big deal.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:27.810
It looks like Poco-chan's made 
fast friends with Merukuru.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.700
M-Merukuru... chan?

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.010
That's right.

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:35.070
She loves people and she's a very good dog!

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:38.260
Would you like to pet her, too?

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.070
Huh?!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.060
Er... Uh...

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:44.080
I do like fluffy things, but...

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.620
Welp, I've got someplace to be.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.830
Wait! Nakajima?!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.410
Souta, doggie?

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:58.120
She said you can play with 
the doggie again another time.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.470
Anyway, what did you have to do?

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.960
I'm supposed to meet my pa.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.230
<b>Ding</b>

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:19.240
<b>Hot Water Bottle</b>

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.240
Souta-kun, good to see ya.

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.990
What's this? You've got a kid now?

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:25.490
Ah, no... Just taking care of a friend's kid.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:26.740
Hey!

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:29.880
Ya said he was hurt so bad, he couldn't get up,

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.620
so I came by outta concern, 
but he looks just fine!

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:36.540
Well, Shinobu, you hardly ever 
visit home, even if I call you.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.730
So I played a little trick on you.

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.260
Ma!

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:43.260
But really, it was awful!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.650
I heard a scream coming from the greenhouse,

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.010
<b>Argh!</b>

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.420
and when I rushed over, 
there was your father,

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.700
flat on the ground and 
staring down a caterpillar.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.650
It scared me half to death!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.610
<i>They have a greenhouse in their yard?</i>

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.150
Bug?

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.610
That's right! It was this big!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.910
Wow!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.540
I don't know what you're growin' in there,

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.670
but ain't buildin' that thing 
in the yard a little much?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:13.630
What?!

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:16.040
Quit doin' things you're too old to do.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.020
Who're you callin' old?!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:22.630
You're the one drivin' that flashy car like 
you're a grown man, when you're just a brat!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:25.050
Huh?! That has nothin' to do with this!

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:28.060
And you're driftin' about instead 
of takin' over the business...

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:39.570
Poco!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.780
Yowch!

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:44.150
There, there.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:46.970
Owie owie, fly away!

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.660
<i>Air Crusher Poco!</i>

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:52.630
This ain't nothin'—

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.230
Yowch!

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:56.290
He's been like this the whole time.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:01.000
I told him he should just have 
you take him to a hot spring...

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:04.070
What? Just me an' Pa? No way!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:06.000
Oh, but this is perfect.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.280
Souta-kun and the little
one could go with you.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.810
Huh? Oh, no, no! We...

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:16.100
Who wants to take a bath?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:16.990
Me!

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.230
Wow.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:24.020
Who knew such a modern building 
would house a hot spring?

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:28.380
I hear the owner built 
this place when he came

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.990
back home to Kagawa after workin' 
in Tokyo at an architectural firm.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.620
Oh, really?

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:37.500
Okay, banzai!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.000
Banzai!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.090
You two take yer time together.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.330
Uh, what?! Nakajima?!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.470
Hey!

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:56.980
Bath... Outside?!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.100
Yep, it's an open-air bath.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.240
Open-air...

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:03.730
Open-air!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.470
Nakaji! Breezy!

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.360
Open-air. Wow!

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:11.870
Yeah, yeah. Loud, aren't ya?

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.370
Time to wash up.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.560
<i>This is extremely awkward...</i>

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:25.610
Sorry, boy.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:29.510
Huh?! Er, I wasn't thinking that 
this was awkward or anything!

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.680
I meant that ya got caught up 
in this father-son spat of ours.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.390
Oh, that?

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.140
Is it so bad to have spats?

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:44.650
Way back when, we fought 
as he was startin' college, too.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:48.150
He said, "I ain't gonna be a doctor, 
and I ain't gonna take over the business!"

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:51.470
He wouldn't listen to a thing I said.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.980
Dunno what changed his mind, 
but suddenly he came out

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.580
Clean Nakaji, too!

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.160
an' declared he'd go to medical school.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:59.160
Ah, I see now. It was right around then...

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:58.500
Harder!

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:02.460
When ya got hurt.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.920
You can barely see the scar anymore.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:10.090
Course ya can't. I sewed it up myself.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.930
Souta!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.160
All clean!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.360
Okay, soak up to your shoulders.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.690
So warm...

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.190
Paradise.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.720
<i>Go 'way, go 'way!</i>

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:00.880
Huh?! Poco?!

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:07.000
He just got a little dizzy.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.610
He's fine.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.010
Thank you...

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:13.160
Which do ya want, fruit milk or coffee milk?

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.940
Fruit...

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.740
Hey, Nakajima!

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.320
Nakajima!

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:22.500
Nakajima,

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.630
you're obviously avoiding your father.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:33.110
You should

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.170
talk to him while you still can.

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:42.520
I know. I know that, but...

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:46.710
It's strange. I can talk to you,

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:48.560
but not to my pa...

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:51.400
Even though we're family.

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:55.910
I think it's <i>because</i> you're family.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.310
Yeah, maybe.

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:08.690
Peach, apple, strawberry...

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.140
What's that? Ya like fruit, do ya?

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:12.670
I like it.

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:16.860
This! I like this!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.430
Pineapple!

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:23.980
Oh? Ya like pineapples?

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:24.810
Uh-huh!

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:26.620
When Shinobu was little,

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:29.980
he liked pineapples, too.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.580
Nakaji, bye-bye!

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:41.910
Grampa, bye-bye!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.240
Yowch!

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:26.250
Honestly... Stay still!

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:30.010
A little higher— Ow, ow, ow...

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.290
Shinobu?

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.550
That pineapple...

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:43.560
It's good.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.020
Course it is!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:52.190
I grew 'em myself!

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.970
It's still a little sour.

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.540
That's just the way they should be!

00:18:58.540 --> 00:18:59.200
Ouch!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:02.460
Oh, dear...

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.080
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:08.380
Pineapple, pineapple...

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.070
Did you have fun at the bath?

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:14.840
Fun! Wanna go again.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:17.920
With Nakaji, and Grampa!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:18.980
Yeah, we will.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.600
<b>Work 
Incoming Call</b>

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.730
Hello, Tawara speaking.

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:44.430
Souta-san! We're in big trouble!

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:44.920
Huh?

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.600
Souta?

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:25.970
<b>Gaogao-chan and</b>

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:25.970
<b>The Blue Sky</b>

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:27.950
<i>The Tale of Gaogao-chan and</i>

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.970
<b>Episode 5: 
"Gaogao-chan and the Friends-Again Magic"</b>

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:31.050
<i>the Friends-Again Magic!</i>

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:35.480
<i>Oh, you've done it this time!</i>

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.350
<i>I'll never, ever forgive you!</i>

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:38.920
<i>You wanna fight?!</i>

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:41.950
<i>Mimi and Momo are together 24/7,</i>

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:42.360
<i>You scheming witch!</i>

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:44.250
<i>365 days a year.</i>

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.250
<i>Shut up, flatso!</i>

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.640
<i>And on some days, they fight a little.</i>

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:51.610
<i>Dummy.</i>

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:54.080
<i>These pitiful Earthlings</i>

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:56.130
<i>and their ugly fights...</i>

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:01.610
<i>Just then, Gaogao-chan remembered</i>

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:04.150
<i>the magical Earth waters 
known as "hot springs,"</i>

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:05.830
<i>whose magic could stop fights.</i>

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:06.940
<i>I will dig, Gao!</i>

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:19.580
<i>It's a hot spring!</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:21.660
<i>Wanna go in?</i>

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:22.470
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:25.150
<i>It's so warm!</i>

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:27.400
<i>Yeah, it's nice and steamy!</i>

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:29.710
<i>So not sexy, Gao...</i>

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:33.150
<i>Huh? Gaogao-chan, there's 
something on your back.</i>

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:35.590
<i>Gao! That's...</i>

