<b>Udon Prefecture 
Vice Governor</b>

00:22:42.900 --> 00:22:45.320
Since I came to Tokyo, I often visit it and

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:47.050
climb up to the observation deck.

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:49.100
It's a place that reminds 
you of your ideals.

